rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/deployments","created_at":"2013-05-06T16:37:13Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T22:21:40Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T03:06:04Z","git_url":"git://github.com/xunit/xunit.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:xunit/xunit.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit","homepage":"https://xunit.net/","size":18675,"stargazers_count":4495,"watchers_count":4495,"language":"C#","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":823,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":58,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c-sharp","dotnet","unit-testing","xunit"],"visibility":"public","forks":823,"open_issues":58,"watchers":4495,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Given the following test:\n\n```csharp\nusing System;\nusing Xunit;\n\nnamespace Test;\n\npublic class MyClassFixture : IDisposable\n{\n    public void Dispose() =>\n        throw new Exception();\n}\n\npublic class TestClass : IClassFixture<MyClassFixture>\n{\n    [Fact]\n    public void TestMethod() { }\n}\n```\n\nWhen run, the following message is displayed:\n\n```\n[Test Class Cleanup Failure (<unknown test class>)] Xunit.Sdk.TestPipelineException\n  Class fixture type 'Test.MyClassFixture' threw in Dispose\n```\n\nThe `<unknown test class>` is displayed because the test messages come out of order. We should expect `ITestClassCleanupFailure` to precede `ITestClassFinished`, but they are reversed, so the reporter no longer has access to the class metadata (since it will be removed from the cache during `ITestClassFinished`).\n\nUpon examining the runner classes, they are all reporting these messages out of order.\n\nSlight architectural changes need to be made to the runner base classes in order to rearrange the code execution order so that these messages are reported in the correct order.\n\n_Discovered while investigating #3213_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3221/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T23:13:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T23:13:44Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/5248","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/5248/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/test